---
layout: app-layout.njk
title: Syncing – Climbing Logbook
bundle: sync
staticShellNote: |-
  Genuinely static shell (#498/ADR-0019), same pattern as public/
         log/index.html -- see that file's own comment for why every path
         below is absolute and client/sync-main.js reads the username from
         location.pathname itself rather than this file being templated.
         No <climbing-tab-bar> here -- unlike /log, /map, /performance,
         this page isn't one of the three real destinations; it's a
         transient stop nothing should navigate into deliberately, so
         there's nothing to highlight as "current" and no other page is
         usable yet anyway.
---
<div class="max-w-[960px] mx-auto">
  {% set headerClass = "mb-6" %}{% include "page-header.njk" %}

  <div class="row-card text-center max-w-[420px] mx-auto mt-8" id="sync-card">
    <p class="text-[.95rem] text-foreground" id="sync-message">Syncing your logbook&hellip;</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted mt-1" id="sync-detail">Setting things up</p>
    <div class="mt-4 h-2 rounded-full bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--color-text)_12%,transparent)] overflow-hidden" role="progressbar" aria-labelledby="sync-message" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" id="sync-progress-track">
      <div class="h-full rounded-full bg-accent transition-[width] duration-300" id="sync-progress-fill" style="width: 0%"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row-card text-center max-w-[420px] mx-auto mt-8" id="sync-error" hidden>
    <p class="text-[.9rem] text-foreground">Couldn't sync your logbook.</p>
    <p class="text-[.82rem] text-muted mt-2">Check your connection and try again.</p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary mt-4" id="sync-retry-btn">Retry</button>
  </div>

</div>
